This repository is a fork of Infomaniak's kDrive one with changes for Linux distributions:

- Allow using system log4cplus
- Allow using system utf8proc
- Allow using system xxHash
- Allow using system SQLite3
- Use a SYSCONFDIR variable for the default exclusion list (to be FHS compliant)
- Install an optional systemd user file
- Fix a crashpad related variable

As an example, a package for openSUSE is available here: https://build.opensuse.org/package/show/home:krop/kdrive
It contains post-install fixes fixes (https://build.opensuse.org/projects/home:krop/packages/kdrive/files/kdrive.spec?expand=1):
- to remove unneeded static libkeychain and headers
- to delete an unneeded crashpad_handler copy

